Spec refs: REQ-VERIFY-4032, SCENARIO-VERIFY-4032.

This runner ports the GAP-4 demo-fit execution primitive from ARC grids to a
standard code-synthesis setting. Candidate programs are generated by a local
Gemma 4 12B GGUF, executed through Carnot's sandbox-compatible function runner,
selected by vote / ACES / visible demo-fit, and scored only afterward on held-out
tests.
